{"page":409,"verses":[{"verse_key":"30:42","surah":30,"ayah":42,"ar_uthmani":"قُلْ سِيرُوا۟ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ فَٱنظُرُوا۟ كَيْفَ كَانَ عَـٰقِبَةُ ٱلَّذِينَ مِن قَبْلُ ۚ كَانَ أَكْثَرُهُم مُّشْرِكِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Say, ‘Travel through the land, and see how those before you met their end- most of them were idolaters.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"30:42"},{"pos":2,"ar":"سِيرُوا۟","en_gloss":"Travel","transliteration":"sīrū","verse_key":"30:42"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"30:42"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"30:42"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَٱنظُرُوا۟","en_gloss":"and see","transliteration":"fa-unẓurū","verse_key":"30:42"},{"pos":6,"ar":"كَيْفَ","en_gloss":"how","transliteration":"kayfa","verse_key":"30:42"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"was","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"30:42"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَـٰقِبَةُ","en_gloss":"(the) end","transliteration":"ʿāqibatu","verse_key":"30:42"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"30:42"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"(were) before","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"30:42"},{"pos":11,"ar":"قَبْلُ ۚ","en_gloss":"(were) before","transliteration":"qablu","verse_key":"30:42"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"Most of them were","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"30:42"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَكْثَرُهُم","en_gloss":"Most of them were","transliteration":"aktharuhum","verse_key":"30:42"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مُّشْرِكِينَ","en_gloss":"polytheists","transliteration":"mush'rikīna","verse_key":"30:42"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٤٢","en_gloss":"(42)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"30:42"}]},{"verse_key":"30:43","surah":30,"ayah":43,"ar_uthmani":"فَأَقِمْ وَجْهَكَ لِلدِّينِ ٱلْقَيِّمِ مِن قَبْلِ أَن يَأْتِىَ يَوْمٌ لَّا مَرَدَّ لَهُۥ مِنَ ٱللَّهِ ۖ يَوْمَئِذٍ يَصَّدَّعُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Prophet], stand firm in your devotion to the upright religion, before an irresistible Day comes from God. On that Day, mankind will be divided:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَأَقِمْ","en_gloss":"So set","transliteration":"fa-aqim","verse_key":"30:43"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَجْهَكَ","en_gloss":"your face","transliteration":"wajhaka","verse_key":"30:43"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِلدِّينِ","en_gloss":"to the religion","transliteration":"lilddīni","verse_key":"30:43"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْقَيِّمِ","en_gloss":"right","transliteration":"l-qayimi","verse_key":"30:43"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"30:43"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَبْلِ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"qabli","verse_key":"30:43"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"[that]","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"30:43"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَأْتِىَ","en_gloss":"comes","transliteration":"yatiya","verse_key":"30:43"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَوْمٌۭ","en_gloss":"a Day","transliteration":"yawmun","verse_key":"30:43"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"30:43"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَرَدَّ","en_gloss":"(can be) averted","transliteration":"maradda","verse_key":"30:43"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"[it]","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"30:43"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"30:43"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۖ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"30:43"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","en_gloss":"That Day","transliteration":"yawma-idhin","verse_key":"30:43"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يَصَّدَّعُونَ","en_gloss":"they will be divided","transliteration":"yaṣṣaddaʿūna","verse_key":"30:43"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٤٣","en_gloss":"(43)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"30:43"}]},{"verse_key":"30:44","surah":30,"ayah":44,"ar_uthmani":"مَن كَفَرَ فَعَلَيْهِ كُفْرُهُۥ ۖ وَمَنْ عَمِلَ صَـٰلِحًا فَلِأَنفُسِهِمْ يَمْهَدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"those who rejected the truth will bear the burden of that rejection, and those who did good deeds will have made good provision for themselves.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"Whoever","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"30:44"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَفَرَ","en_gloss":"disbelieves","transliteration":"kafara","verse_key":"30:44"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَعَلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"then against him","transliteration":"faʿalayhi","verse_key":"30:44"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كُفْرُهُۥ ۖ","en_gloss":"(is) his disbelief","transliteration":"kuf'ruhu","verse_key":"30:44"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَمَنْ","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"30:44"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَمِلَ","en_gloss":"does","transliteration":"ʿamila","verse_key":"30:44"},{"pos":7,"ar":"صَـٰلِحًۭا","en_gloss":"righteousness","transliteration":"ṣāliḥan","verse_key":"30:44"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَلِأَنفُسِهِمْ","en_gloss":"then for themselves","transliteration":"fali-anfusihim","verse_key":"30:44"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَمْهَدُونَ","en_gloss":"they are preparing","transliteration":"yamhadūna","verse_key":"30:44"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٤٤","en_gloss":"(44)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"30:44"}]},{"verse_key":"30:45","surah":30,"ayah":45,"ar_uthmani":"لِيَجْزِىَ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ مِن فَضْلِهِۦٓ ۚ إِنَّهُۥ لَا يُحِبُّ ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"From His bounty God will reward those who believe and do good deeds; He does not like those who reject the truth.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لِيَجْزِىَ","en_gloss":"That He may reward","transliteration":"liyajziya","verse_key":"30:45"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"30:45"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"30:45"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"and do","transliteration":"waʿamilū","verse_key":"30:45"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"righteous deeds","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","verse_key":"30:45"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"(out) of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"30:45"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَضْل