loss":"and that may sail","transliteration":"walitajriya","verse_key":"30:46"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْفُلْكُ","en_gloss":"the ships","transliteration":"l-ful'ku","verse_key":"30:46"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِأَمْرِهِۦ","en_gloss":"at His Command","transliteration":"bi-amrihi","verse_key":"30:46"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَلِتَبْتَغُوا۟","en_gloss":"and that you may seek","transliteration":"walitabtaghū","verse_key":"30:46"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"30:46"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَضْلِهِۦ","en_gloss":"His Bounty","transliteration":"faḍlihi","verse_key":"30:46"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَلَعَلَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"and that you may","transliteration":"walaʿallakum","verse_key":"30:46"},{"pos":17,"ar":"تَشْكُرُونَ","en_gloss":"be grateful","transliteration":"tashkurūna","verse_key":"30:46"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٤٦","en_gloss":"(46)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"30:46"}]},{"verse_key":"30:47","surah":30,"ayah":47,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ أَرْسَلْنَا مِن قَبْلِكَ رُسُلًا إِلَىٰ قَوْمِهِمْ فَجَآءُوهُم بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ فَٱنتَقَمْنَا مِنَ ٱلَّذِينَ أَجْرَمُوا۟ ۖ وَكَانَ حَقًّا عَلَيْنَا نَصْرُ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Before you [Muhammad], We sent mes-sengers, each to their own people: they brought them clear proofs and then We punished the evildoers. We make it Our duty to help the believers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And verily","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"30:47"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَرْسَلْنَا","en_gloss":"We sent","transliteration":"arsalnā","verse_key":"30:47"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"30:47"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قَبْلِكَ","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"qablika","verse_key":"30:47"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رُسُلًا","en_gloss":"Messengers","transliteration":"rusulan","verse_key":"30:47"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"30:47"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قَوْمِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their people","transliteration":"qawmihim","verse_key":"30:47"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَجَآءُوهُم","en_gloss":"and they came to them","transliteration":"fajāūhum","verse_key":"30:47"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"with clear proofs","transliteration":"bil-bayināti","verse_key":"30:47"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَٱنتَقَمْنَا","en_gloss":"then We took retribution","transliteration":"fa-intaqamnā","verse_key":"30:47"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"30:47"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"30:47"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَجْرَمُوا۟ ۖ","en_gloss":"committed crimes","transliteration":"ajramū","verse_key":"30:47"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَكَانَ","en_gloss":"And it was","transliteration":"wakāna","verse_key":"30:47"},{"pos":15,"ar":"حَقًّا","en_gloss":"incumbent","transliteration":"ḥaqqan","verse_key":"30:47"},{"pos":16,"ar":"عَلَيْنَا","en_gloss":"upon Us","transliteration":"ʿalaynā","verse_key":"30:47"},{"pos":17,"ar":"نَصْرُ","en_gloss":"(to) help","transliteration":"naṣru","verse_key":"30:47"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_gloss":"the believers","transliteration":"l-mu'minīna","verse_key":"30:47"},{"pos":19,"ar":"٤٧","en_gloss":"(47)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"30:47"}]},{"verse_key":"30:48","surah":30,"ayah":48,"ar_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ ٱلَّذِى يُرْسِلُ ٱلرِّيَـٰحَ فَتُثِيرُ سَحَابًا فَيَبْسُطُهُۥ فِى ٱلسَّمَآءِ كَيْفَ يَشَآءُ وَيَجْعَلُهُۥ كِسَفًا فَتَرَى ٱلْوَدْقَ يَخْرُجُ مِنْ خِلَـٰلِهِۦ ۖ فَإِذَآ أَصَابَ بِهِۦ مَن يَشَآءُ مِنْ عِبَادِهِۦٓ إِذَا هُمْ يَسْتَبْشِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is God who sends out the winds; they stir up the clouds; He spreads them over the skies as He pleases; He makes them break up and you see the rain falling from them. See how they rejoice when He makes it fall upon whichever of His servants He wishes,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"al-lahu","verse_key":"30:48"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(is) the One Who","translit